Subject: [PATCH 161/207] runner proof: apply T1's 256-digit division and
 powmod proof patches

tools/runner-graph-wide-division-proof.patch then tools/runner-graph-wide-powmod-proof.patch,
as 4d194e8cc and 2689a844c ask. The five new Dispatch proofs move to runner_proof_wide_test.zig
so runner_proof_test.zig stays under the 600-line cap; it exports Both, Count and finish to them.
